  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Overlay a lensing convergence map on an optical image, measure how far mass and light are offset and where their shapes disagree across an ensemble of lens models, and export a JSON evidence receipt and a FITS discrepancy map, with real-data, user-upload and synthetic-validation routes kept separate. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
